&lt;/style&gt;
&lt;div class="sentence-list"&gt;
&lt;div class="study-title"&gt;一. 正向情绪类笑容&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="sentence-item"&gt;
 &lt;span class="sentence-number"&gt;01&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="cn-sentence"&gt;. 幸福的笑容使她容光焕发。&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;div class="en-sentence"&gt;Smile of happiness brightened her face.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="sentence-item"&gt;
 &lt;span class="sentence-number"&gt;02&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="cn-sentence"&gt;. 友善的笑容温暖了每个人的心。&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;div class="en-sentence"&gt;Smile of kindness warmed everyone's heart.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="sentence-item"&gt;
 &lt;span class="sentence-number"&gt;03&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="cn-sentence"&gt;. 自信的笑容提升了他的士气。&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;div class="en-sentence"&gt;Smile of confidence boosted his morale.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="study-title"&gt;二. 满足感类笑容&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="sentence-item"&gt;
 &lt;span class="sentence-number"&gt;04&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="cn-sentence"&gt;. 满意的笑容浮现在他的嘴角。&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;div class="en-sentence"&gt;Smile of satisfaction showed on his lips.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="sentence-item"&gt;
 &lt;span class="sentence-number"&gt;05&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="cn-sentence"&gt;. 兴奋的笑容在她眼中闪耀。&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;div class="en-sentence"&gt;Smile of excitement sparkled in her eyes.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="sentence-item"&gt;
 &lt;span class="sentence-number"&gt;06&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="cn-sentence"&gt;. 宽慰的笑容在他的面容上展开。&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;div class="en-sentence"&gt;Smile of relief spread across his features.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="study-title"&gt;三. 情感表达类笑容&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="sentence-item"&gt;
 &lt;span class="sentence-number"&gt;07&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="cn-sentence"&gt;. 感激的笑容表达了她的谢意。&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;div class="en-sentence"&gt;Smile of gratitude expressed her thankfulness.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="sentence-item"&gt;
 &lt;span class="sentence-number"&gt;08&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="cn-sentence"&gt;. 纯真的笑容让这个孩子很可爱。&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;div class="en-sentence"&gt;Smile of innocence made the child adorable.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="sentence-item"&gt;
 &lt;span class="sentence-number"&gt;09&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="cn-sentence"&gt;. 爱意的笑容充满了这对夫妇的双眼。&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;div class="en-sentence"&gt;Smile of love filled the couple's eyes.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="study-title"&gt;四. 特质类笑容&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="sentence-item"&gt;
 &lt;span class="sentence-number"&gt;10&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="cn-sentence"&gt;. 神秘的笑容增添了他的魅力。&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;div class="en-sentence"&gt;Smile of mystery added to his charm.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="sentence-item"&gt;
 &lt;span class="sentence-number"&gt;11&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="cn-sentence"&gt;. 胜利后的得意笑容出现了。&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;div class="en-sentence"&gt;Smile of triumph appeared after the victory.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="sentence-item"&gt;
 &lt;span class="sentence-number"&gt;12&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="cn-sentence"&gt;. 好奇的笑容照亮了他的脸。&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;div class="en-sentence"&gt;Smile of curiosity lit up his face.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="sentence-item"&gt;
 &lt;span class="sentence-number"&gt;13&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="cn-sentence"&gt;. 谦虚的笑容让她更受尊重。&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;div class="en-sentence"&gt;Smile of modesty made her more respected.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;script&gt;
document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function() {
